<div class="ap-page sp-page" data-ap-page="scoring-preview" data-api-base="/Widget/Api">
    <nav class="ap-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/Dashboard">AskPearls</a><span class="ap-breadcrumb-separator" aria-hidden="true"> / </span><span aria-current="page">Scoring &amp; Preview</span></nav>
    <header class="ap-page-header"><div><h1 class="ap-page-title">Scoring &amp; Preview</h1><p class="ap-page-description">Configure temporary answer scores and preview ranked recommendations for your widget.</p></div><span class="sp-demo-badge"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i> Preview only</span></header>
    <section class="sp-widget-selector ap-widget-selector" aria-label="Active widget"><button type="button" id="spCreateWidgetButton" class="sp-create-widget-button" title="Create new widget" aria-label="Create new widget"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="sp-selector-icon"><i class="bi bi-grid-1x2"></i></div><div class="sp-selector-info"><label for="spWidgetSelect">Select widget</label><select id="spWidgetSelect" class="form-select" disabled><option value="">Loading widgets…</option></select><small id="spWidgetMessage" class="sp-selector-message" aria-live="polite">Choose a widget to preview.</small></div><div class="sp-current-version"><span>Draft / live</span><strong id="spWidgetVersion">—</strong></div></section>
    <div id="spPageAlert" class="alert d-none" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div id="spWorkspace" class="d-none">
        <div class="row g-3 mb-4"><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="sp-stat"><span class="text-muted small">Points per answer</span><strong id="spPointsPerAnswer">50</strong><small>Distribute points across active recommendations.</small></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="sp-stat"><span class="text-muted small">Questions</span><strong id="spQuestionCount">0</strong><small>From the selected widget.</small></div></div><div class="col-12 col-md-4"><div class="sp-stat"><span class="text-muted small">Maximum score</span><strong id="spMaximum">0</strong><small>Questions × 50.</small></div></div></div>
        <div class="sp-panel mb-4"><div class="sp-panel-head"><div><h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">1. Configure answer allocations</h5><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Choose an answer and allocate its points among active recommendations.</p></div><button type="button" id="spResetAllocations" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">Reset allocations</button></div><div class="sp-panel-body"><div class="row g-3 mb-3"><div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="spEditQuestion">Question</label><select id="spEditQuestion" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-12 col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="spEditAnswer">Answer option</label><select id="spEditAnswer" class="form-select"></select></div></div><div id="spAllocationEditor" class="row g-3"></div><div class="sp-allocation-footer mt-3"><div><span class="text-muted small">Allocated points</span><strong id="spAllocationTotal">0 / 50</strong></div><span id="spAllocationStatus" class="sp-invalid" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="sp-progress mt-2"><div id="spAllocationBar" style="width:0%"></div></div><p class="text-muted small mt-3 mb-0"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Preview only: allocations remain in this page and are not saved to the database.</p></div></div>
        <div class="sp-panel mb-4"><div class="sp-panel-head"><div><h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">2. Simulate a visitor</h5><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Choose visitor answers to recalculate rankings instantly.</p></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" id="spResetAnswers"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i> Reset answers</button></div><div class="sp-panel-body"><div class="row g-3" id="spVisitorAnswers"></div></div></div>
        <div class="sp-panel mb-4"><div class="sp-panel-head"><div><h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">3. Ranked recommendations</h5><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Rankings use the temporary allocations and selected visitor answers.</p></div></div><div class="sp-panel-body"><div id="spRanking"></div><div id="spRankingEmpty" class="text-muted small d-none">Correct every allocation total to 50 to preview results.</div></div></div>
        <div class="sp-panel"><div class="sp-panel-head"><div><h5 class="mb-1 fw-bold">4. Score breakdown</h5><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Exact points contributed by each selected answer.</p></div></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table sp-table align-middle mb-0"><thead id="spBreakdownHead"></thead><tbody id="spBreakdown"></tbody><tfoot id="spBreakdownFooter"></tfoot></table></div></div>
    </div>
</div>
